  "document": "Schenectady County, New York\nSchenectady County ( ) is a county located in the U.S. state of New York. As of the 2010 census, the population was 154,727. The county seat is Schenectady. The name is from a Mohawk language word meaning \"on the other side of the pine lands,\" a term that originally applied to Albany."
